<title>ITALY: April air cargo down 33pct at Forli.</title>
<headline>April air cargo down 33pct at Forli.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo traffic handled at Forli airport fell 33 percent in April 1997 to 212 tonnes compared to the same month last year, Forli airport authority SEAF said.</p>
<p>In the period, January-April this year cargo handled at the airport totalled 1232 tonnes, down 28 percent.</p>
</text>
